        "raw": "<p>Am I missing a pun on the word Dense?</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Isn't the actual music piece Danse Macabre?</p>\r\n\r\n<p>I'm a sucker for supernatural villains, so someone like your Grimmalkin could be a lot of fun to use as a 'force of (un-)nature'.&nbsp; If you're looking for accomplices or the like, the March entries in The Big Villains Thread are all mystic themed, and October's entries are all monsters.&nbsp; Check the index for a brief rundown of all of them!</p>",
