        "id": 224982,
        "name": "Anubis",
        "username": "Anubis",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/anubis/{size}/4949_2.png",
        "created_at": "2019-01-10T02:45:02.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"PlatinumWarlock\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/platinumwarlock/48/1869_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> PlatinumWarlock:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Am I missing a pun on the word Dense?</p>\n<p>Isn’t the actual music piece Danse Macabre?</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Danse Macabre is a style of artwork to celebrate life after death. (what Mexicans do for Day of The Dead) Dense as in a dense number of undead so it’s a pun. Basically saying Crap ton of undead!!! In a poetic pun.&nbsp;</p>",
