        "raw": "[quote=\"PlatinumWarlock\"]\n\nAm I missing a pun on the word Dense?\n\nIsn't the actual music piece Danse Macabre?\n[/quote]\n\nDanse Macabre is a style of artwork to celebrate life after death. (what Mexicans do for Day of The Dead) Dense as in a dense number of undead so it's a pun. Basically saying Crap ton of undead!!!! In a poetic pun.&nbsp;\n",
